# Direct environment for the bounded QLoRA SFT pilot.
# The first eight pins preserve the SFT semantic contract validated in
# requirements/train-constraints.txt. The explicit bitsandbytes pin enables
# QLoRA; the five final pins cover the actual AtlasOps SFT runner import
# boundary (coordinator API, HTTP clients, and tool-message rendering).
# This is not an editable AtlasOps install and excludes dev, vLLM, GRPO,
# evaluation, tracking, and optional cloud/dashboard extras.
